{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Common"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.eta_q_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.eta_q_pos","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L121-L126","doc":"`η_q > 0` for `q_0 > 1/2` (in particular for our `q_0 > 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.eta_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.eta_q","kind":"def","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L118-L119","doc":"**Operational entropy**: `η_q := (2q_0 - 1) / q_0^3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0_sqrt_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0_sqrt_pos","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L113-L116","doc":"`√q_0 > 0` (immediate from `q_0 > 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.markovParameter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.markovParameter","kind":"def","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L107-L111","doc":"**Markov parameter**: `z := 1 / (q_0^{1/2} + q_0^{-1/2})`.  This\nis the eigenvalue of the Markov-trace stabilisation operator\n(per `prop:markov-trace-axioms`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.c_q_mul_hbar_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.c_q_mul_hbar_q","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L101-L105","doc":"`c_q · ℏ_q = 1 / q_0`.  Identity `(1 / (q_0 - 1)) · ((q_0 - 1) /\nq_0) = 1 / q_0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.hbarQ_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.hbarQ_pos","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L96-L99","doc":"`ℏ_q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.hbarQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.hbarQ","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L93-L94","doc":"**Planck constant in cat units**: `ℏ_q := (q_0 - 1) / q_0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.c_q_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.c_q_pos","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L88-L91","doc":"`c_q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.c_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.c_q","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L85-L86","doc":"**Speed of light in cat units**: `c_q := 1 / (q_0 - 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0_sub_one_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0_sub_one_pos","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L81-L83","doc":"`q_0 - 1 > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L77-L79","doc":"`q_0 ≠ 0` (immediate from `q_0 > 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L70-L75","doc":"`q_0 > 1` (categorical-derivation property).\n**Theorem** (was previously an `axiom`).  Discharged 2026-06-07\nby `norm_num` against the literal `def q_0` above. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/QSubstrate.lean#L46-L68","doc":"**The QOU substrate parameter** `q_0`.\n\n**`def` form** (was previously an `axiom`).  Discharged\n2026-06-07 in PR #1978 via the same placeholder-literal pattern\nused for `H3BraneTowerScaffold.q0` (same numerical value: the\n50-dps decimal expansion from\n`computations/full-twist-delta-n2-verification.witness.json::q_0`,\nproduced by the proton-anchor re-pin of 2026-05-28 in\n`tools/qou-substrate/python/qou_substrate/constants.py::Q_50_DIGIT_STR`).\n\nConsumer audit (2026-06-07): only `QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Realification`\nreferences `q_0` by name, and only via the derived `q_0_ne_zero`.\nOther downstream files (`PerNucleusMassDerivation`,\n`JonesMarkovWenzl`, `HeckeAlgebra` root module) `open` the\nnamespace but don't read the symbol — they parameterise on `q`\ngenerically. Locking `q_0` to a literal therefore does not\nconstrain any downstream proof; a future refactor will rebind\nthis `def` to the substrate-derivation pipeline output once the\n`def:m-mu-over-m-e-calibration` Lean port lands. ","signatureChunk":0}]}